# Reviewed ignore file for the image scan gate (ci.yml, job image-scan).
#
# The gate fails a pull request on any HIGH or CRITICAL vulnerability that has a fix.
# An entry here is a decision, not a shortcut. Each one needs, on the line above it:
#   - why it does not apply to this service, or why it cannot be fixed yet,
#   - who reviewed it, and the date by which it must be looked at again.
# Remove the entry as soon as a fixed base image or package is available.
#
# Format: one vulnerability id per line, for example
#   # libfoo in the base image; not reachable: the service never parses foo files.
#   # Reviewed by <name> 2026-11-24, revisit by 2026-12-24.
#   CVE-2026-00000
#
# Current entries: none.
